OL,3,GNEWSAResidents at care home 'not safe
OL,4,Afrom neglect'
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn inspection has found that residents
OL,7,Fat a Shropshire care home were not
OL,8,Fconsistently protected from neglect and
OL,9,Fwere put at risk of being injured or
OL,10,Fcatching infections.
OL,12,FDanesford Grange Care Home, in
OL,13,FBridgnorth, is run by MGC Care Limited,
OL,14,Fand provides accommodation for elderly
OL,15,Fpeople requiring nursing care, older
OL,16,Fadults and those with a diagnosis of
OL,17,Fdementia.
OL,19,FThe Care Quality Commission (CQC)
OL,20,Fvisited the site in June and downgraded
OL,21,Fits overall rating from good to
OL,22,Finadequate.
OL,23,APub: 04-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,358,350,200,160,0,100
